# Force LF line endings for files that must run on Linux (the pattern-engine VM,
# GitHub Actions). A CRLF systemd unit leaves a trailing \r on ExecStart and fails
# with "No such file or directory"; a CRLF shell script fails with "bad interpreter".
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
*.timer text eol=lf
*.conf  text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
